# Project Customization: Huashu Design

Follow the Huashu Design philosophy and protocols defined in [.vscode/huashu-design.md](.vscode/huashu-design.md) for all high-fidelity design tasks.

Key Constraints:
- Fact-check specific products/brands first.
- Always prefer real assets (logos, photos) over generic placeholders or SVG drawings.
- Use the "Junior Designer" flow: show assumptions before implementation.
- Avoid AI slop (generic gradients, emoji icons, etc.).
- For mobile prototypes, use the provided iOS/Android frames and ask for the desired delivery style.
